<div class="hero slim rounded-4 p-5"><h1>About Alzikrayat</h1><p class="lead mb-0">A handcrafted photo-sharing application built to preserve everyday memories.</p></div><div class="row mt-5 g-4"><div class="col-md-4"><h3><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i> Private by design</h3><p class="text-muted">Passwords are securely hashed, sessions are protected, and photo deletion verifies ownership.</p></div><div class="col-md-4"><h3><i class="bi bi-code-slash"></i> Built from scratch</h3><p class="text-muted">A clear MVC and 3-tier architecture with a regex-powered manual router and prepared SQL queries.</p></div><div class="col-md-4"><h3><i class="bi bi-phone"></i> Made for every screen</h3><p class="text-muted">Bootstrap layout and responsive gallery styles make the experience comfortable on mobile, tablet, and desktop.</p></div></div>
